          <rdf:li>Multi</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Everyone needs hugs and therapy by the end of this</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Also Catra almost dies three times</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>alternative universe</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>A lot of angst and mutual pining</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>What if Catra made the right choice earlier and Horde Prime contacted her before he arrived?</rdf:li>
